## Solar Tracking System
### Block Diagram
```mermaid
flowchart LR
    L[Light Sensors (LDR)] --> C[Microcontroller]
    C --> A[Actuator Driver]
    A --> P[Dual-Axis Motor]
    P --> S[Solar Panel Mount]
    C --> M[Monitoring Interface]
```

### Flowchart
```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Read sensor pairs]
    B --> C[Compare east vs west light]
    C --> D{Difference > tolerance?}
    D -- No --> E[Hold position]
    E --> B
    D -- Yes --> F[Rotate toward brighter side]
    F --> G[Update position log]
    G --> B
```
